    "type": "markdown",
    "content": "### Which clock\nPick a clock and every card below switches to it. The picker is `input_select.wall_clock_target`.\n\nAdding another clock: give it a different `name:` in ESPHome (that sets its entity prefix, hostname and OTA target), add it to `CLOCKS` in `build_clock_dashboard.py`, and to the options of the input_select."
  },
