  {
    "type": "markdown",
    "visibility": [
      {
        "condition": "state",
        "entity": "input_select.wall_clock_target",
        "state": "Mini Round Clock"
      }
    ],
    "content": "### Mini Round Clock \u2014 Colour\nThe presets **default, warm, cool, mono** ignore the sliders below. Set **Theme** to **custom** first, then they apply immediately, no reflash.\n\n*Intensity* is the ring's brightness for that element, not the screen's \u2014 the screen reuses the same hue at its own brightness, because a bare LED and a backlit panel don't want the same value.\n\nStatus **pips** follow the timer arc at 62% and have no separate control. **mono** pins every saturation to zero and is the accessible palette."
  },
